<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Festa on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tags/festa/</link><description>Recent content in Festa on Blog de Pocallum — camera &amp; action!</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ca</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 18 May 2025 00:00:00 +0200</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/tags/festa/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2025-0517 - Nou Barris meets Nova Orleans - BKT Brass Band</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/05/18/2025-0517-nou-barris-meets-nova-orleans-bkt-brass-band/</link><pubDate>Sun, 18 May 2025 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2025/05/18/2025-0517-nou-barris-meets-nova-orleans-bkt-brass-band/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/kVfR1qypybHMMDcA7"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/DSCF0935-1024x683.jpg" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Un moment en què la &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/bktbrassband/"&gt;BKT Brass Band&lt;/a&gt; la va liar a &amp;ldquo;&lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/date_una_huerta/"&gt;Date Una Huerta&lt;/a&gt;&amp;rdquo; hort ocupat i autogestionat per les veïnes de la Prosperitat&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ahir vam tornar a gaudir d’una jornada molt especial dedicada a la cultura musical de Nova Orleans, un esdeveniment que ja s’ha convertit en una cita imprescindible a Nou Barris. L’Ateneu Popular de Nou Barris ha celebrat la sisena edició de “&lt;a href="https://ateneu9b.net/ca/programacions/nou-barris-meets-nova-orleans-v6"&gt;Nou Barris meets Nova Orleans&lt;/a&gt;”, una festa plena de ritme, color i bon ambient.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2023-05-25 - Inici de Festa Major!!</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/05/25/2023-05-25-inici-de-festa-major/</link><pubDate>Thu, 25 May 2023 00:00:00 +0200</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2023/05/25/2023-05-25-inici-de-festa-major/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/qbsV2srEJGB7VWAk6"&gt;&lt;img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/g1OWbVYwXqE1mDJZOkjHsJgKTGz7dPVmgaNt19nuqfLUHj2Hr6ETdoVUxfW4SvrlNj0LZ2YrQI5OwUHcgrxGCjxSFSMae1WYIWbD83yD5xl4_oeFRIAk7EhdeB--K6zAz14Vc0iY_6yKHZLYjSpZ5r7BQGgGBl_uyb1EMU4HHIMuy9qmR8o0B-pDdddPeboAbQ_Exg4Ep51QmljGCRczvvyg3I5O0cVkyG3dBM-vlyPMSFg3N3g5D9VeNTik52hnYFjQVVIQhL4Aq7sWwrJ4-vPldKFH6MIJoB7d_ZJD0P7KonqqwXoj2-3Ir_Yn8gW4anlAT1heqxyVUeTNquQ-BUcEGjHWpy1YFjQW7IQqnfuTT5O6_oUT7k8GpEAeCrnoC7dSUZQRra1xlCatK4sEuLIBGa4XOVGtRBv7nFwqhYkZvxnzkQJQMNz85y_caaAfw7H41R8BlB_8YSBi99ONdZVk-TsBvQHKt-rbjucItdMefK-PgBntocEq0Hde-X9R6ScHZVFRXXrtPzewevLqBwRi8aSj63OWQWJjdBC9O5W4qqZu1bZXF2FFI2CxCgt3xyZ34TnKxOa3AoPE7GK3nLM_NwLHqQxppCxk-VoB2AnuyUdS1xX-oHlSLh0QU7V4yy_PqtrYmkSG6DfMMQJ14qG7rJDLMZd32QX-GdGN7F0w4TWFJV_aEE57weRl5onvAXwKNPID5HFl7qNrJqph4coGZ3pgLXFaljx2H0rvPYM5OWLgGY70wY1142nSWe6GXy7YOEMAcreOO9TP6-9nUcAosxg527KbiSFPfQ56FwS1qxVakpCSeMR51GsIsnko8lVE3GBt4XBQ_is8AMMoX2jdASz_P66e3hUoRtHdez6xuh6bPouNqRlghfBSiLXfdJ6wg9CLZk0WRAHsFDATd79dK7HveivrqX-qbegFdruVSg=w718-h404-no?authuser=0" alt=""&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Socorro!! Avui he pres consciència que la festa major de la Prosperitat ja és aquí! Jo he baixat al casal ben tranquil a fer un got amb els compis de 9bi i de sobte..&lt;br&gt;
Actuació de &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/@sonidomanglar1469"&gt;Sonido Manglar&lt;/a&gt;, una gent amb molta marxa (Organitzat per les amigues de &lt;a href="https://www.instagram.com/rudascooperativa/"&gt;Rudas&lt;/a&gt; Cooperativa)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alhora s&amp;rsquo;iniciava al costat el famós Sopar Immortal, la colla més R&amp;rsquo;n&amp;rsquo;R de la Prosperitat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Així que cuideu-vos molt que cal molta energia per sobreviure a la 45 Festa Major de Prosperitat.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Al Babia recordant el Ramonet</title><link>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2019/11/28/al-babia-recordant-el-ramonet/</link><pubDate>Thu, 28 Nov 2019 00:00:00 +0100</pubDate><guid>https://112books.github.io/blog.pocallum.cat/2019/11/28/al-babia-recordant-el-ramonet/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://photos.app.goo.gl/RDH6rnqJ2KVPsXNm6"&gt;&lt;img src="https://blog.pocallum.cat/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/hc468-003.jpg" alt="hc468-003"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
